	"data": "Godot XR Template\n\nStarter project with XR plugins and tools pre-configured. Your starting point.\nRepo: <https://github.com/GodotVR/godot-xr-template>\nLicense: MIT\nGodot version: 4.x\nStatus: Maintained\n\nWhat It Provides\nPre-configured XR project with godot-xr-tools and openxr vendors plugin\nBasic demo game scene\nExport presets for Quest and desktop\n\nRelevance\nClone this to start the spatial authoring project. Saves the setup dance.\n\nRelated\n[[godot-xr-tools]] — bundled in…",
